WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.800
The January 2021 document is a deferred
prosecution agreement. Read paragraph two
for the company’s acknowledgment of
responsibility.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:17.600
In November 2025, a separate district
court order granted the government’s
motion to dismiss the charge.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:24.040
The agreement and the order document
different steps. Put them on separate
lines in the timeline.
